 ### Material Synchronization LUT Adjustment
-An algorithm to adjust a 1D Look-Up Table (LUT) mapping sample values to material indices, ensuring that the distribution of sample values across materials is synchronized with the frame number and material centers [S17, unofficial]. It calculates a common base allocation range `d` as `frameNumber / colorKind` and initializes material center positions `indexM[i]` to `d*i + d / 2` [S17, unofficial].
